  "evidence": "- TEXT_E: End the NHS internal market, shift money from administration to care, treat 100,000 extra patients, ban tobacco advertising, and create an independent Food Standards Agency; 250,000 under‑25s into work via welfare‑to‑work and clamp down on fraud; cut infant class sizes and provide universal nursery places with rigorous standards targets; tough on crime and its causes with faster youth sentencing, sentencing guidelines, Youth Offender Teams, and better victim support; fiscal 'golden rule' and Bank of England independence, tougher competition law, Low Pay Commission‑set minimum wage, and union recognition by vote; defence rooted in NATO, retain Trident, EU leadership, and constitutional reform/devolution within the UK alongside ECHR incorporation and FOI.\n- TEXT_C: Trigger independence negotiations and referendum, written constitution, reform the monarchy, and exclude any House of Lords role; remove Trident, phased withdrawal from NATO, and create Scottish Defence Forces; increase child benefit, restore 16–17s benefits, pensioner package, NHS funding boost and anti‑tobacco measures; Bill of Rights with social rights, PR voting, vote at 16, minimum wage and trade union charter; business tax cuts and tax changes (15p starter rate, remove NI ceiling); phase out nuclear power and invest in renewables.",
